        "zoom": [
          1,
          1.06
        ]
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Un día llegó un forastero a las puertas de Asgard, con un enorme caballo a su lado.",
          "en": "One day a stranger arrived at the gates of Asgard, with a huge stallion beside him."
        },
        {
          "es": "Dijo que era constructor y que levantaría una muralla que ningún gigante podría cruzar.",
          "en": "He said he was a builder, and that he would raise a wall no giant could cross."
        },
        {
          "es": "Prometió terminarla en tres inviernos.",
          "en": "He promised to finish it in three winters."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y pidió tres cosas como pago: a la diosa Freyja como esposa, el Sol y la Luna.",
          "en": "As payment he asked for three things: the goddess Freyja as his wife, the Sun and the Moon."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los dioses se quedaron en silencio, porque ese precio era imposible de pagar.",
          "en": "The gods fell silent, because that price was impossible to pay."
        }
      ],
