      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Faltaban tres días para el verano, y la muralla estaba casi terminada.",
          "en": "Three days were left before summer, and the wall was almost finished."
        },
        {
          "es": "Solo faltaba la entrada.",
          "en": "Only the gateway was still missing."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces los dioses entendieron lo que habían hecho: iban a perder a Freyja, el Sol y la Luna.",
          "en": "Then the gods saw what they had done: they were about to lose Freyja, the Sun and the Moon."
        },
        {
          "es": "Se reunieron furiosos y culparon a Loki, porque el trato había sido idea suya.",
          "en": "They gathered in anger and blamed Loki, because the deal had been his idea."
        },
        {
          "es": "Lo amenazaron con una muerte terrible si no encontraba cómo evitar que el constructor cobrara.",
          "en": "They threatened him with a terrible death unless he found a way to stop the builder from being paid."
        },
        {
          "es": "Loki, aterrado, juró que lo arreglaría.",
          "en": "Loki, terrified, swore that he would fix it."
        }
      ],
