      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Esa noche, el constructor fue al bosque con Svaðilfari a buscar más piedras.",
          "en": "That night, the builder went into the forest with Svaðilfari to fetch more stones."
        },
        {
          "es": "De pronto salió de entre los árboles una yegua, relinchando.",
          "en": "Suddenly a mare came out of the trees, neighing."
        },
        {
          "es": "Svaðilfari la vio, rompió su arnés y salió galopando detrás de ella.",
          "en": "Svaðilfari saw her, broke his harness and galloped after her."
        },
        {
          "es": "El constructor corrió tras ellos gritando, pero los dos caballos se perdieron en el bosque toda la noche.",
          "en": "The builder ran after them, shouting, but the two horses vanished into the forest all night."
        },
        {
          "es": "La yegua era Loki, que había cambiado de forma para salvar a los dioses.",
          "en": "The mare was Loki, who had changed his shape to save the gods."
        }
      ],
