      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Sin su caballo, el constructor no pudo terminar a tiempo, y entendió que había perdido.",
          "en": "Without his horse, the builder could not finish in time, and he knew he had lost."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces se enfureció y dejó de fingir: era un gigante.",
          "en": "Then he flew into a rage and stopped pretending: he was a giant."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los dioses lo vieron y comprendieron que nunca había sido un simple constructor.",
          "en": "The gods saw this and understood that he had never been a simple builder."
        },
        {
          "es": "Rompieron sus juramentos y llamaron a Thor, que acababa de volver del este.",
          "en": "They broke their oaths and called Thor, who had just come back from the east."
        },
        {
          "es": "Thor levantó su martillo, Mjölnir, y de un solo golpe lo mandó a las profundidades de Niflhel, el mundo de los muertos.",
          "en": "Thor raised his hammer, Mjölnir, and with one blow sent the giant down to Niflhel, the world of the dead."
        },
        {
          "es": "Así Freyja, el Sol y la Luna se salvaron, y los dioses se quedaron con la muralla.",
          "en": "So Freyja, the Sun and the Moon were saved, and the gods kept their wall."
        }
